<title>FRANCE: France firm buys 5 pct of India's IL&amp;FS.</title>
<headline>France firm buys 5 pct of India's IL&amp;FS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Commercial de France said on Wednesday it bought five percent of the capital of the Indian company Infrastructure Leasing &amp; Financial Services Ltd (IL&amp;FS).</p>
<p>IL&amp;FS was created in 1988 by three of India's biggest financial institutions -- Central Bank of India, Unit Trust of India and Housing Development Finance Corporation Ltd.</p>
<p>Its activities include financing industrial and infrastructure projects and advising companies.</p>
<p>The cost of the transaction was not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
